-- Purpose : 
--           Synopsys synthesis timing constraint script for the 
--           AACI block             
--
--           Located in the synopsys/scripts directory.   
--
--           This file specifies the point-to-point exceptions 
--           set for the AACI block synthesis. 
--
-- --=================================================================*/

/* False paths between the APB clock domain and the AC-Link domain   */
/* are present due to the following reasons:                         */
/* - Single bit signals crossing domains are double-synchronised     */ 
/*   and can hence be declared false.                                */
/* - Vector signals are synchronised using the 2-buffer technique    */
/*   and are effectively multi-cycle. Since the PCLK and AACIBITCLK  */
/*   frequencies may be completely asynchronous and non-integral,    */
/*   setting a false path is much easier than setting an MCP.        */ 
/* - The Integration Vector Strategy has resulted in un-synchronised */
/*   paths between the PCLK and the AACIBITCLK domains. These can    */
/*   also be safely declared as false.                               */ 
/* AACIBITCLK to PCLK */ 
set_false_path -from {AACIBITCLK} -to {PCLK}

/* PCLK to AACIBITCLK */ 
set_false_path -from {PCLK} -to {AACIBITCLK}

/* nAACIBITCLK to PCLK */ 
set_false_path -from {nAACIBITCLK} -to {PCLK}

/* PCLK to nAACIBITCLK */ 
set_false_path -from {PCLK} -to {nAACIBITCLK}

/******************** End of Aaci_exceptions.scr **********************/
